# Stress position for large boards: Zirda, the Dawnwaker makes Basalt Monolith's untap cost {1}, so each tap and
# untap nets two colorless, and 99 loops float 201 for a Forth Eorlingas! with X = 201. Handed over as Bot1 declares
# attackers with 201 hasty Knights beside seven other permanents on the battlefield, to time game actions against a board
# of two hundred permanents and look at it in the client.
#
# Turn 1 casts both Moxen, then Sol Ring off Mox Ruby and Zirda off the Plateau, Mox Pearl and Sol Ring. Turn 3 casts the
# Monolith off Sol Ring and a Mox, and keeps both Plateaus for the {R}{W}. Each untap is let resolve before the
# next tap; the pool keeps its mana while the ability resolves, within the one main phase.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plateau
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Zirda, the Dawnwaker
Basalt Monolith
Forth Eorlingas!
Plateau x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

